  <emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">A mixture in which one substance of microscopically dispersed insoluble or soluble particles (from 1 nm to 1 μm) is suspended throughout another substance and that does not settle, or would take a very long time to settle appreciably.</emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
  <emmo:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f xml:lang="en">Colloids are characterized by the occurring of the Tyndall effect on light.</emmo:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f>
</owl:Class>

