  <emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">For a given unit system, measured constants are physical constants that are not used to define the unit system. Hence, these constants have to be measured and will therefore be associated with an uncertainty.</emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
</owl:Class>

