  <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">EquilibriumConstant</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The physical dimension can change based on the stoichiometric numbers of the substances involved.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">for solutions, product for all substances B of concentration c_B of substance B in power of its stoichiometric number v_B: K_p = \sum_B{c_B^{v_B}}.</rdfs:comment>
