  <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">AmperePerDegreeCelsius</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A measure used to express how a current is subject to temperature. Originally used in Wien's Law to describe phenomena related to filaments. One use today is to express how a current generator derates with temperature.

-- QUDT</rdfs:comment>
