  <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">UnitPole</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A magnetic pole is a unit pole if it exerts a force of one dyne on another pole of equal strength at a distance of 1 cm. The strength of any given pole in cgs units is therefore numerically equal to the force in dynes which it exerts on a unit pole 1 cm away.

-- QUDT</rdfs:comment>
