  <emmo:EMMO_33ae2d07_5526_4555_a0b4_8f4c031b5652 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">kg/h</emmo:EMMO_33ae2d07_5526_4555_a0b4_8f4c031b5652>
  <emmo:EMMO_7f1dec83_d85e_4e1b_b7bd_c9442d4f5a64 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">kg/h</emmo:EMMO_7f1dec83_d85e_4e1b_b7bd_c9442d4f5a64>
  <emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">Kilogram Per Hour (kg/h) is a unit in the category of Mass flow rate. It is also known as kilogram/hour. Kilogram Per Hour (kg/h) has a dimension of MT-1 where M is mass, and T is time. It can be converted to the corresponding standard SI unit kg/s by multiplying its value by a factor of 0.000277777777778.

-- QUDT</emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
