  <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ArchetypeManufacturing</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A manufacturing in which the product is a solid body with a well defined geometrical shape made from shapeless original material parts, whose cohesion is created during the process.</rdfs:comment>
