  <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Poundal</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The poundal is a unit of force that is part of the foot-pound-second system of units, in Imperial units introduced in 1877, and is from the specialized subsystem of English absolute (a coherent system). The poundal is defined as the force necessary to accelerate 1 pound-mass to 1 foot per second per second. 1 pdl = 0.138254954376 N exactly.

-- QUDT</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">http://qudt.org/2.1/vocab/unit</rdfs:isDefinedBy>
  <core:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Poundal</core:prefLabel>
  <emmo:EMMO_1f1b164d_ec6a_4faa_8d5e_88bda62316cc rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/PDL</emmo:EMMO_1f1b164d_ec6a_4faa_8d5e_88bda62316cc>
  <emmo:EMMO_33ae2d07_5526_4555_a0b4_8f4c031b5652 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">[lb_av].[ft_i].s-2</emmo:EMMO_33ae2d07_5526_4555_a0b4_8f4c031b5652>
  <emmo:EMMO_7f1dec83_d85e_4e1b_b7bd_c9442d4f5a64 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">pdl</emmo:EMMO_7f1dec83_d85e_4e1b_b7bd_c9442d4f5a64>
  <emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">The poundal is a unit of force that is part of the foot-pound-second system of units, in Imperial units introduced in 1877, and is from the specialized subsystem of English absolute (a coherent system). The poundal is defined as the force necessary to accelerate 1 pound-mass to 1 foot per second per second. 1 pdl = 0.138254954376 N exactly.

-- QUDT</emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
  <emmo:EMMO_c84c6752_6d64_48cc_9500_e54a3c34898d rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Poundal?oldid=494626458</emmo:EMMO_c84c6752_6d64_48cc_9500_e54a3c34898d>
