  <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ChargeNumber</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">For a particle, electric charge q divided by elementary charge e.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The charge number of a particle may be presented as a superscript to the symbol of that particle, e.g. H+, He++, Al3+, Cl−, S=, N3−.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The charge number of an electrically charged particle can be positive or negative. The charge number of an electrically neutral particle is zero.</rdfs:comment>
  <core:altLabel xml:lang="en">IonizationNumber</core:altLabel>
  <core:prefLabel xml:lang="en">ChargeNumber</core:prefLabel>
  <emmo:EMMO_1f1b164d_ec6a_4faa_8d5e_88bda62316cc rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/ChargeNumber</emmo:EMMO_1f1b164d_ec6a_4faa_8d5e_88bda62316cc>
