  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">PicoMolePerLitrePerDay</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A change in the quantity of matter of 10⁻¹² moles in the SI unit of volume scaled by 10⁻³ over a period of 86400 seconds.

-- QUDT</rdfs:comment>
