  <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">DegreePerMinute</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A unit of measure for the rate of change of plane angle, dω / dt,  in durations of one minute.The vector ω is directed along the axis of rotation in the direction for which the rotation is clockwise.

-- QUDT</rdfs:comment>
