  <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">NewtonPerMetre</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Newton Per Meter (N/m) is a unit in the category of Surface tension. It is also known as newtons per meter, newton per metre, newtons per metre, newton/meter, newton/metre. This unit is commonly used in the SI unit system. Newton Per Meter (N/m) has a dimension of MT-2 where M is mass, and T is time. This unit is the standard SI unit in this category.

-- QUDT</rdfs:comment>
