  <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">FreeForming</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Free forming is pressure forming with tools that do not or only partially contain the shape of the workpiece and move against each other.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Non la metterei</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Printing forms with tools that do not or only partially contain the shape of the workpiece and move against each other. The workpiece shape is created by free or fixed relative movement between the tool and the workpiece (kinematic shape generation).</rdfs:comment>
  <core:prefLabel xml:lang="en">FreeForming</core:prefLabel>
</owl:Class>

