  <emmo:EMMO_70fe84ff_99b6_4206_a9fc_9a8931836d84 xml:lang="en">Degree is a measurement of plane angle, defined by representing a full rotation as 360 degrees.</emmo:EMMO_70fe84ff_99b6_4206_a9fc_9a8931836d84>
