  <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">EmpiricalSimulationSoftware</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational application that uses an empiric equation to predict the behaviour of a system without relying on the knowledge of the actual physical phenomena occurring in the object.</rdfs:comment>
