  <emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">The relation between a process P1 that proper overlaps a process P2, where the non-overlapping part of P2 causes P1.</emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
