  <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="en">One-dimensional manifolds include lines and circles, but not self-crossing curves. Two-dimensional manifolds are also called surfaces. Examples include the plane, the sphere, and the torus, and also the Klein bottle and real projective plane.</owl:annotatedTarget>
  <emmo:EMMO_c84c6752_6d64_48cc_9500_e54a3c34898d rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manifold</emmo:EMMO_c84c6752_6d64_48cc_9500_e54a3c34898d>
</owl:Axiom>

